## Interface: 11507
# ^ Tracks the WoW Classic Era client patch (1.15.07). Bump this number when
#   the client patches; nothing inside the addon keys off it.
## Title: WoW Mobile
## Notes: Portrait touch UI overhaul for streaming WoW Classic Era to a phone (1080x1920 window, 1080x1080 world viewport + control deck).
## Author: WoW Mobile project
## Version: 1.0.0
## SavedVariables: WowMobileDB

# Load order is the dependency order: Core provides the namespace/bus/queue,
# Compat the API shims, Config the saved variables, Viewport the world square
# and deck rect, Deck the panel/scroller/menu infrastructure. Bar and HUD
# modules then stack bottom-up inside the deck (each anchors to the frame the
# previous module published in WM.Layout; Pet also anchors its status strip
# to the unit row UnitFrames publishes), and the panel modules only depend on
# Deck. MoveMode sits right after Deck: ActionBars/Spellbook/CharacterPanel/
# Bags call its file-scope API from their cell factories. SheetKit (shared
# economy-sheet infrastructure) follows MoveMode: its bag-list rows hand off
# to MoveMode.Begin, and the economy sheets (AuctionHouse/Crafting/Mail/
# Bank/Trade — after RollFrames, ordered freely among themselves; they build
# on Kit.CreateSheet/NewStack/steppers/bag list plus the Compat auction and
# mail wrappers) require it loaded before
# them. The round-3 interaction
# sheets (Stable/Inspect/Reader — event-driven replacements for banished
# default frames) and the Social panel also build on SheetKit's stack/
# text-field kit, so they sit with the other SheetKit consumers; Raid and
# CharacterPanel need only Core/Deck/Viewport (and MoveMode for
# CharacterPanel's gear cells). WorldMap reflows
# Blizzard's map over the deck (ARCHITECTURE §4); Talents reflows
# Blizzard_TalentUI into the world square. LootSheet/RollFrames only need
# Core/Deck/Viewport (they replace default frames banished in Blizzard.lua).
# Settings loads last because its panel drives Config + Viewport.
Core.lua
Compat.lua
Config.lua
Blizzard.lua
Viewport.lua
Deck.lua
MoveMode.lua
SheetKit.lua
ActionBars.lua
QuickBar.lua
XPBar.lua
UnitFrames.lua
CastBar.lua
Auras.lua
Pet.lua
